Quadrate Compiler
=================

The Quadrate compiler (quadc) and related tools are licensed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0.

See <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.html> for the full text.

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

This includes:
- cmd/         (compiler, tools)
- lib/qc/      (parser, AST)
- lib/llvmgen/ (code generator)
- lib/qdcli/   (CLI utilities)


Quadrate Standard Library
=========================

The Quadrate standard library is licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

See LICENSE-STDLIB for the full text.

SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

This includes:
- lib/qdrt/    (runtime library)
- lib/qd/      (embedding API)
- lib/qd*/     (standard library modules: qdio, qdstr, qdmath, etc.)

Programs compiled with Quadrate link against the standard library and
runtime, which are permissively licensed. You may distribute your
compiled programs under any license you choose.
